From 27faf44fcebd24f8fed7c7bea4438a12bc73833a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 17:03:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Prose profile: ProseDraw, and ProseWriter 0.1-3, both in
 Office

ProseDraw, the drawing program developed in the Prose repository
(prosedraw/), goes into the image and into the Deskbar's Office folder
beside ProseWriter. ProseWriter moves to 0.1-3: its latest state, where
the caret follows typing and tables are real grids. Both are packaged
by prosepkg from the committed state of their trees
(packages/builder/overlay/haiku-apps/), never from a working copy.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Prose-Patch: 0088-prose-profile-prosedraw-and-prosewriter-0-1-3-both-in-office.patch c973bfe96d515b26d1ccec9760d8fd2422e4d5d82c9c270335580b7d645947e0
---
 build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles          | 1 +
 build/jam/DeskbarCategories             | 1 +
 build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64 | 3 ++-
 3 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles b/build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles
index d27141b234..f062ad28c9 100644
--- a/build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles
+++ b/build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles
@@ -315,6 +315,7 @@ rule DefineDefaultBuildProfiles
 				ponpokodiff
 				ponyexpress
 				ppviewer
+				prosedraw
 				prosewriter
 				querywatcher
 				remember
diff --git a/build/jam/DeskbarCategories b/build/jam/DeskbarCategories
index c80b11e4e0..b4e5079c98 100644
--- a/build/jam/DeskbarCategories
+++ b/build/jam/DeskbarCategories
@@ -134,6 +134,7 @@ DESKBAR_CATEGORY_Office =
 	Lingua
 	"Mr. Peeps!"
 	People
+	ProseDraw
 	ProseWriter
 	TimeTracker
 	Tolmach
diff --git a/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64 b/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
index 816d9454f5..3c0b5318cd 100644
--- a/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
+++ b/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
@@ -204,7 +204,8 @@ RemotePackageRepository HaikuPorts
 	romannumbers-1.0~git-2
 	samedi-1.2-1
 	shredder-1.0.0-3
-	prosewriter-0.1-2
+	prosedraw-0.1-1
+	prosewriter-0.1-3
